A-2.3 Coaxial Connectors Connectors are installed on the end of a coaxial cable to provide electrical and mechanical connection to a system component.  Either male or female connectors can be attached to coaxial cable, but most installations use male connectors on cable ends.
There are many styles of coaxial cable connectors.  Three popular styles are:
